ase_v4 h2, body.base_v3.base_v4 .h2 {    font-size: 36px;  }  body.base_v3.base_v4 h3, body.base_v3.base_v4 .h3 {    font-size: 28px;  }  body.base_v3.base_v4 h4, body.base_v3.base_v4 .h4 {    font-size: 24px;  }  body.base_v3.base_v4 h5, body.base_v3.base_v4 .h5 {    font-size: 20px;  }}@media (min-width: 1281px) {  body.base_v3.base_v4 h1, body.base_v3.base_v4 .h1 {    font-size: 60px;  }  body.base_v3.base_v4 h2, body.base_v3.base_v4 .h2 {    font-size: 48px;  }  body.base_v3.base_v4 h3, body.base_v3.base_v4 .h3 {    font-size: 36px;  }  body.base_v3.base_v4 h4, body.base_v3.base_v4 .h4 {    font-size: 28px;  }  body.base_v3.base_v4 h5, body.base_v3.base_v4 .h5 {    font-size: 24px;  }}</style>   </head>                      <body class=\"body-page theme-en-us  v4_design base_v4\" data-edit-mode>                        <noscript>       <div class=\"no-js-warning\">This site requires Javascript in order to view all its content. Please enable Javascript in order to access all the functionality of this web site. Here are the <a href=\"http://www.enable-javascript.com/\" target=\"_blank\">instructions how to enable JavaScript in your web browser.</a></div>    </noscript>    <div  id=\"page-content\" ><div class=\"content_par parsys\"><div class=\"rawHtml section\">                      <div class=' p-t-0 p-b-0 lap-p-t-0 lap-p-b-0 mob-p-t-0 mob-p-b-0 tab-p-t-0 tab-p-b-0' >                                                                <html> <head>   <link media=\"all\" href=\"https://images.nvidia.com/content/GRD/Shared/styles/articleStyle.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">   <script src=\"https://images.nvidia.com/pascal/js/jquery-1.12.1.min.js\"></script>   <script src=\"https://assets.adobedtm.com/b92787824f2e0e9b68dc2e993f9bd995339fe417/satelliteLib-f5e6896bceda788f02e36771464a3bcbb5ae094b.js\"></script>   <meta content=\"Upgrade To The NVIDIA App For New Features &amp; More\" name=\"gfeTitle\">   <meta content=\"By NVIDIA on 2026-05-26\" author=\"NVIDIA\" date=\"2026-05-26\" name=\"gfeAuthor\">   <meta content=\"GeForce Experience is no longer being updated. Please upgrade to the NVIDIA app for continued support and new drivers.\" name=\"gfeDescription\">   <meta content=\"Upgrade To The NVIDIA App For New Features &amp; More\" name=\"gfeName\">  </head>  <body class=\"article\">   <div class=\"article maindiv\">    <p><a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/software/nvidia-app/\">The NVIDIA app</a> is the essential companion for users with NVIDIA GPUs in their PCs and laptops. Whether you're a gaming enthusiast or a content creator, NVIDIA app simplifies the process of keeping your PC updated with the latest GeForce Game Ready and NVIDIA Studio Drivers, enables quick discovery and installation of NVIDIA applications, and allows you to enhance hundreds of games and apps with DLSS overrides, accelerating performance and improving image quality.</p>    <!--  <div class=\"container\">    <button class=\"nvidia-btn\">NVIDIA App</button>  </div>-->    <p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/software/nvidia-app/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://images.nvidia.com/aem-dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/geforce/news/upgrade-to-nvidia-app/download-now-button.png\" alt=\"\" title=\" \" width=\"33%\" height=\"40px;\"></a> </p>    <p>If you’re seeing this, you’re one of our few remaining GeForce Experience users. And the version of GeForce Experience you’re using is unable to automatically update to the NVIDIA app. We don’t want you to lose access to popular features like ShadowPlay, Optimal Playable Settings, and the NVIDIA Overlay, so please update now to the NVIDIA app <a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/software/nvidia-app/\">by downloading it from our website</a>, or installing it via our latest <a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/drivers/\">Game Ready Driver</a>.</p>    <p>In the near future, we will be switching off critical GeForce Experience web servers, so if you want to continue enhancing your games, apps and experiences <strong>please upgrade to the NVIDIA app.</strong></p>    <h3>Key Features Of The NVIDIA App</h3>    <p>The NVIDIA app has even more features than GeForce Experience, and enhancements for fan favorites, like ShadowPlay:</p>    <ul>     <li><a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/news/nvidia-app-dlss-4-5-dynamic-multi-frame-generation-available-now/\">Upgrade DLSS games with the latest features and AI models on all GeForce RTX GPUs</a>, further improving image quality. And on GeForce RTX 50 Series GPUs, upgrade to Dynamic Multi Frame Generation!</li>     <li>Use the popular <a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/news/nvidia-app-global-dlss-overrides-rtx-40-series-smooth-motion\">NVIDIA Smooth Motion</a> feature to accelerate games without Frame Generation</li>     <li>Capture your best moments <a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/news/nvidia-app-download-and-features/#overlay\">at up to 4K 120 FPS, in HDR, with the latest version of ShadowPlay</a></li>     <li>Check frame rates and other metrics in-game with new NVIDIA Overlay Statistics</li>     <li><a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/news/nvidia-app-update-dlss-overrides-and-more/#rtx-video\">Apply HDR to SDR games and videos with RTX HDR</a>, improve the fidelity of videos and streams with RTX Super Resolution, and apply a wider range of enhanced filters to your games with the latest version of NVIDIA Freestyle</li>     <li>NVIDIA Control Panel options have been modernized and incorporated directly into the NVIDIA app, enabling you to control all aspects of your experience from one central location</li>     <li>Optimal Playable Settings have been further improved</li>     <li>Seamlessly switch between Game Ready and Studio Ready drivers through the NVIDIA app</li>     <li>Claim GeForce Rewards from NVIDIA app, giving you skins and other perks for games</li>     <li>Download and install other NVIDIA applications through the NVIDIA app, including GeForce NOW, Project G-Assist, NVIDIA Broadcast, and NVIDIA Remix</li>    </ul>    <p align=\"center\"> <iframe width=\"49%\" height=\"247\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4gOCg_j-sLM\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\"></iframe> &nbsp; <iframe width=\"49%\" height=\"247\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/u4cfzFd9HzU\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\"></iframe> </p>    <p align=\"center\"> <iframe width=\"49%\" height=\"247\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4g1udxztjgk\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\"></iframe> &nbsp; <iframe width=\"49%\" height=\"247\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hKNVrsUUX58\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\"></iframe> </p>    <p><a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/software/nvidia-app/\">Please download and install NVIDIA app now</a> to ensure continued access to NVIDIA features, and to access a suite of new enhancements that makes games, apps and experiences even better.</p>   </div>   <script type=\"text/javascript\">_satellite.pageBottom();</script>    </body></html>    </div> </div></div></div>",
